From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LECH OS <dev@lech-os.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Do not use Google's remote key provisioning server

Cuttlefish points rkpd at preprod-remoteprovisioning.googleapis.com. Without
remote_provisioning.hostname rkpd does not provision keys and does not connect anywhere;
key attestation is unavailable on LECH OS Cuttlefish until LECH OS has its own provisioning.

LECH OS task E2-06: no connections to Google without consent.
---
 shared/device.mk | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/shared/device.mk b/shared/device.mk
index ae03410..436baba 100644
--- a/shared/device.mk
+++ b/shared/device.mk
@@ -70,7 +70,6 @@ $(call inherit-product, $(SRC_TARGET_DIR)/product/emulated_storage.mk)
 # partition, instead of the vendor partition, and do not need vendor
 # sepolicy
 PRODUCT_PRODUCT_PROPERTIES += \
-    remote_provisioning.hostname=preprod-remoteprovisioning.googleapis.com \
     persist.adb.tcp.port=5555 \
     ro.com.google.locationfeatures=1 \
     persist.sys.fuse.passthrough.enable=true \
